<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Sotto Q1 profit up 249 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco Sotto Q1 profit up 249 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ending March 31</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	     3.99    vs   1.14</p>
<p>    Banking activity	   50.2     vs  38.9</p>
<p>    Net assets		    5.23    vs   4.74</p>
<p>    Cashflow		     24.1     vs  12.1</p>
<p>    Staff costs		  17.9     vs  18.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Banco Pinto &amp; Sotto Mayor form parts of the Champalimaud group.  </p>
<p>    Deposits		  3,579.0     vs 3,311.0</p>
<p>    Client loans	    2,254.0     vs 1,846.0</p>
<p>    Financial margin	   36.15    vs    28.63</p>
<p>    Cashflow		     23.78    vs    13.75</p>
</text>
